OverTheWire Bandit: Level 21 → 22

Objective
Obtain the password for Level 22.
A cron job running as bandit22 executes a script that stores the password in a temporary file.

Steps
Log in as bandit21:
ssh bandit21@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
View the cron job script:
cat /etc/cron.d/cronjob_bandit22
Read the script being executed:
cat /usr/bin/cronjob_bandit22.sh
Display the generated password file:
cat /tmp/<generated-file>

Result
The temporary file contains the password for Bandit Level 22.
